# Nothing here is served by the site, and shipping it to the build only gives
# Vercel more chances to decide this is a project that needs compiling.
#
# supabase/ holds Deno TypeScript edge functions and SQL migrations. They are
# deployed to Supabase with its own CLI, never by Vercel.
supabase/

node_modules/
out/

# Local tooling and scratch files.
*.cjs
*.out
report_probe*
.claude/
